            "review_title": "Review at Dasis Tea & Coffee House",
            "review_text": "ichabodcrane8621\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam56 contributions\n0\nComfie and generally quiet place, good coffee\nSep 2017 • Solo\nI come here normally to work in the mornings, it's a well located place in D1, comfortable and good environment, plenty of switches and they don't put pressure on you to leave, they even have free lemon water.\nYet another Korean cafe, but a good place to work. The capuccino is quite decent! Super nice staff.\nThey also have hundreds of manga books, which is cool, even if they are in Vietnamese lol.\n\nAdvice: if you get some pastry and you don't say anything, they will always warm it up... a lot. Also, the music is awful, bring your headphones! haha.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 14, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
